      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: You can't just say 'perchance'.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Eh, whatever. Besides, didn't it feel good to tell someone that story?
        To finally let it out?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: You know... you're right, it did!
